From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@googlemail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:33:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] iOS: per-game data folders and a Files-app data pick

main.m locates the RomFS in the picked location, then Documents/games/<id>/, then the old Documents layout; saves and
temp follow it. Launcher.swift gets a Game data section; front_ios.m goes back to it when no data is found.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Several games in one app, game data on an external drive: Documents/games/<id>/{romfs.img,romfs,msl,save,temp} and a Files-app pick of the data folder (needs the runtime profile). iOS twin of seedds/nxnative#460, which is Mac only. Also add-on content: games/<id>/aoc/<index>.img becomes DM_AOC_DIR (a slim IPA carries none, LNPANDY/NX2Apple#202), before <App>/aoc and never over an explicit value, compatible with the Documents/aoc of seedds/nxnative#486. Also DM_CHEATS=games/<id>/cheats (never over an explicit value), where the launcher's Cheats sheet copies a game's cheat files (LNPANDY/NX2Apple#97)
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#123
